# Strict testing sign-off (Web)

Follow [`../QuickerPay/.cursor/rules/strict-testing-signoff.mdc`](../../QuickerPay/.cursor/rules/strict-testing-signoff.mdc).

Default UI work is **Tier L2**: API-first + one Playwright primary-role flow + Web `pnpm run build` once after UI QA. Agent360 only if Playwright fail/inconclusive, Critical UI, or the user asked to watch. Money/auth/commission screens are **L3** (Agent360 mandatory lean).

Do **not** browser-test every role. Other roles = API asserts. Sign-off Pass/Fail for tier gates only — no pending or “thin” Done.
